{"1714440": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Angels Cove", "steam_appid": 1714440, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Conduct the investigation.</h2><br>Angels Cove is a first-person psychological horror game about conducting a paranormal investigation on a remote island.<br><br>After your boat crashes, recover your equipment, cross the island, enter the abandoned estate, and follow environmental clues as the activity intensifies.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714440/extras/2dc9e999992ec250e6ebe34888dc67c6.avif?t=1787002218\" alt=\"Moonlit shoreline facing the abandoned island estate and lighthouse.\" width=1170 height=658 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the island.</h2><br>Search the shore, outbuildings, lighthouse, graveyard, and house for equipment, clues, collectibles, and items that open new paths.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714440/extras/4d3607b1454b22cea447b7bdc91bb9c1.avif?t=1787002218\" alt=\"A handheld paranormal radio in front of the estate entrance.\" width=1170 height=658 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Document the activity.</h2><br>Use paranormal investigation equipment to track disturbances and uncover the history behind the island and its estate. The closer you get to the truth, the more the haunting escalates.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714440/extras/540e0e086501bb43a1c256653aa5c681.avif?t=1787002218\" alt=\"A haunted doll seated on a couch inside the estate.\" width=1170 height=658 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Explore a remote island, its outbuildings, lighthouse, graveyard, and haunted estate.<br><br></li><li>Recover and use paranormal investigation equipment.<br><br></li><li>Follow environmental clues and find items that unlock new areas.<br><br></li><li>Discover optional collectibles and 11 Steam achievements.<br><br></li><li>Complete the investigation without weapons or combat.</li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Conduct the investigation.</h2><br>Angels Cove is a first-person psychological horror game about conducting a paranormal investigation on a remote island.<br><br>After your boat crashes, recover your equipment, cross the island, enter the abandoned estate, and follow environmental clues as the activity intensifies.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714440/extras/2dc9e999992ec250e6ebe34888dc67c6.avif?t=1787002218\" alt=\"Moonlit shoreline facing the abandoned island estate and lighthouse.\" width=1170 height=658 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the island.</h2><br>Search the shore, outbuildings, lighthouse, graveyard, and house for equipment, clues, collectibles, and items that open new paths.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714440/extras/4d3607b1454b22cea447b7bdc91bb9c1.avif?t=1787002218\" alt=\"A handheld paranormal radio in front of the estate entrance.\" width=1170 height=658 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Document the activity.</h2><br>Use paranormal investigation equipment to track disturbances and uncover the history behind the island and its estate. The closer you get to the truth, the more the haunting escalates.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714440/extras/540e0e086501bb43a1c256653aa5c681.avif?t=1787002218\" alt=\"A haunted doll seated on a couch inside the estate.\" width=1170 height=658 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Explore a remote island, its outbuildings, lighthouse, graveyard, and haunted estate.<br><br></li><li>Recover and use paranormal investigation equipment.<br><br></li><li>Follow environmental clues and find items that unlock new areas.<br><br></li><li>Discover optional collectibles and 11 Steam achievements.<br><br></li><li>Complete the investigation without weapons or combat.</li></ul>", "short_description": "Investigate an abandoned island and its haunted estate in this first-person psychological horror game. Recover paranormal equipment, unlock new areas, follow environmental clues, and uncover the history behind an escalating supernatural presence.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Italian, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“Top 10 Halloween Games for 2021 - Devilish Delights: Another first-person haunted house offering, Angels Cove draws heavily on contemporary ghost stories – in fact, your character is a supernatural investigator sent to explain spooky occurrences on a crumbling island estate – ranging from reality shows like Ghost Hunters to the semi-fictional “based on a true story” films like The Conjuring and its many spin-offs.  You’ve got your haunted dolls, your remote camera set-up, your tape recorder for picking up “electronic voice phenomena” (ghosts talking to you)…but despite the familiarity fans of today’s found-footage horror might feel, it’s extremely effective: this is perhaps the scariest game on our list, and it creates both an encroaching atmosphere of terror – and several effective jump scares – without resorting to gore and violence.”<br>InfinityWaltz - IndieGameReviewer<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714440/header.jpg?t=1787002218", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714440/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787002218", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714440/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787002218", "website": "https://angelscovegame.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit, version 21H1 (build 19043) or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6500 or AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 Ti 4 GB or AMD Radeon RX 570 4 GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 12 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> 64-bit processor and operating system required. Target: 1280×720, Medium quality, 30 FPS. Current vendor graphics drivers recommended.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit, version 21H1 (build 19043) or newer, or Windows 11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 or AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1660 6 GB or AMD Radeon RX 5600 XT 6 GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 12 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Target: 1920×1080, Very High quality, 60 FPS. SSD and headphones recommended. Current vendor graphics drivers recommended.</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "legal_notice": "2021 CG Cowboy Studios LLC", "developers": ["CG Cowboy Studios"], "publishers": ["CG Cowboy Studios"], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 299, "final": 299, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$2.99"}, "packages": [613954], "package_groups": [{"name": "default", "title": "Buy Angels Cove", "description": "", "selection_text": "Select a purchase option", "save_text": "", "displ